{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=5037200&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-11-24T00:53:31Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"5037200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "just volleyball", "steam_appid": 5037200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5037230], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras/91782058f84a490743e6c1ecb513f638.avif?t=1794852941\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong>just volleyball</strong> is an arcade-style action volleyball game that aims to bring a freeform, addicting, and simple volleyball experience to PC, with full online &amp; offline play. with a cursor-based aiming system and fully manual movement, the game may seem simple to pick up, but has a steep and rewarding learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras/8fb52f78e7e68e163ed853ecb582e884.avif?t=1794852941\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras_big/8fb52f78e7e68e163ed853ecb582e884.avif?t=1794852941 width=1560 height=808 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1s, 2v2s, 3v3s, 4v4s, 5v5s... and 6v6!</strong> play whichever format of volleyball you enjoy the most!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>offline &amp; online play:</strong> practice by yourself with bots, or head online!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>character customization:</strong> personalize your player with a simple yet dynamic avatar creation system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>replay mode:</strong> review your highlights &amp; capture cinematic moments!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras/41ff9108c66d76bdcf2df6bcea6771e1.avif?t=1794852941\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras_big/41ff9108c66d76bdcf2df6bcea6771e1.avif?t=1794852941 width=1560 height=830 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras/91782058f84a490743e6c1ecb513f638.avif?t=1794852941\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong>just volleyball</strong> is an arcade-style action volleyball game that aims to bring a freeform, addicting, and simple volleyball experience to PC, with full online &amp; offline play. with a cursor-based aiming system and fully manual movement, the game may seem simple to pick up, but has a steep and rewarding learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras/8fb52f78e7e68e163ed853ecb582e884.avif?t=1794852941\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5037200/extras_big/8fb52f78e7e68e163ed853ecb582e884.avif?t=1794852941 width=1560 height=808 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1s, 2v2s, 3v3s, 4v4s, 5v5s... and 6v6!</strong> play whichever format of volleyball you enjoy the most!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>offline &amp; online play:</strong> practice by yourself with bots, or head online!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>character customization:</strong> personalize your player with a simple yet dynamic ava